{"id":"629525","name":"金针菇莴苣叶拌虾仁","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/629525/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"明虾","amount":"6只"},{"name":"金针菇","amount":"120g"},{"name":"莴苣叶","amount":"180g"}],"sub":[{"name":"无","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"明虾洗净去虾线，冷水下锅。","img":"images/629525/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"煮开5分钟即可。","img":"images/629525/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"捞出去虾壳。","img":"images/629525/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"莴苣叶洗净。","img":"images/629525/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切段。","img":"images/629525/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"金针菇洗净。","img":"images/629525/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"焯水。","img":"images/629525/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"水开2分钟即可。","img":"images/629525/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"所有食材放一起，放小许食盐放辣酱即可。","img":"images/629525/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}